# Warehouse API Documentation
# Refer to apidocs/warehouse.http for full details.

### List Warehouses
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/finance/warehouse/
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Create Warehouse
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/finance/warehouse/
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WH-001",
  "warehouse_name": "Riyadh Central Warehouse",
  "warehouse_type": "main",
  "status": "active"
}
